CLAUDE.md

# Native build artifacts: compiled per-host, never portable between machines.
# `gram.env` and `.gram-build-manifest` record absolute paths for the machine
# that built them -- committing either one makes a fresh clone's first build
# fail against a path that does not exist on it.
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
GRAM Suite 2.0/Build/bin/
GRAM Suite 2.0/Build/lib/
GRAM Suite 2.0/Build/mod/
GRAM Suite 2.0/simulation/GRAM/gram.env
GRAM Suite 2.0/simulation/GRAM/gram.env.ps1
GRAM Suite 2.0/simulation/GRAM/.gram-build-manifest
